they were on their own.

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:29.288
-It's going to be up to the
states to use that capability.

00:06:29.288 --> 00:06:32.124
The states have local points
where they can go.

00:06:32.124 --> 00:06:33.826
A governor can call the mayors

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:35.627
