work and always should work.

00:06:39.665 --> 00:06:42.702
The states should've been
building their stockpiles.

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:44.870
We have almost 10,000
in our stockpile.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.873
We've been building it
and we've been supplying it.

00:06:46.873 --> 00:06:49.942
But the states should be
building. We're a backup.

00:06:49.942 --> 00:06:51.977
We're not an ordering clerk.
We're a backup.

00:06:51.977 --> 00:06:53.679
