They should know

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.353
how many ventilators
they have in their states.

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:02.722
And, by the way, some governors
you speak to, or senators,

00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:04.490
and they don't know what's
in their state.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.924
You know, some governors,
I'll speak to

00:07:05.924 --> 00:07:07.159
