to the number,

00:07:07.159 --> 00:07:08.627
how many ventilators
they have in their state

00:07:08.627 --> 00:07:10.863
'cause that's the first thing
a good manager will do.

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:12.898
-How would you know
what a good manager
is supposed to do?

00:07:12.898 --> 00:07:14.433
You're less qualified
for your job

00:07:14.433 --> 00:07:16.301
than that one
production assistant

00:07:16.301 --> 00:07:17.637
